      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ka Vethan [zone=1283]\n**Who:**\n- Itraer Centien Rashen [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Scroll of Ka Vethan Intel [item=142938]\n- The Rise of the Akhevan Empire [item=142714]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Ka Vethan (10 Points) [quest=10581]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 24 21:28:33 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this task from Itraer Centien Rashen in Ka Vethan. She is located near mid zone and can be found on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Itraer Centien Rashen'\nItraer Centien Rashen is staring at some parchments that she has in each hand; she appears to be very busy but still addresses you. 'Yes, yes. Your [compensation] will be here shortly, please wait with the other mercenaries.'\nYou say, 'I'm getting compensation?'\nItraer Centien Rashen sighs, looking upward in annoyance as if to call out to Luclin herself, 'Ator detra xeturis isa ishta ri thall!' She takes a moment to compose herself before continuing, 'You know the process, you bring us fresh workers, and we pay you for your time. If you have any issues with that, please take it up with Luclin herself. See if she hears your cries. In the meantime, why don't you make yourself useful and collect the writing samples we need. Our work must be [documented] for future generations.'\nYou say, ' Why does it need to be documented if it is already written in stone?'\nItraer Centien Rashen says, 'Only a fool would think that. While the Maiden of Whispers herself has blessed this place, it can still be attacked by those who wish to do harm to our Goddess. We lost many of our finest works during the war and the subsequent destruction wrought by Maiden's Scar. We need to preserve our works in other places just in case something [terrible] happens again.'\nYou say, 'terrible'\nItraer Centien Rashen grimaces for a moment in rage, 'Yes, terrible!' She collects herself again, 'Wait, why am I arguing with you about this? You have work to do now! Take this notebook and go behind the monuments you find in the westernmost room of this temple. There will be some etchings that you need to copy into the book behind each of the statues. Make yourself useful and go collect one from behind each of the [statue] in that room.'\nYou say, 'statue'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Record Scratch'.\nItraer Centien Rashen changes her demeanor and speaks in a more direct tone, 'This monument is dedicated to the rebirth of our people in this new frontier. It tells of the Maiden of Whispers herself, visiting these halls, walking along them and enjoying what we have done in her name. It reminds us that we are always walking in her shadow, and that we deserve to call this moon our home. How we will not stop until we have reclaimed it all in her name.' She looks very serious as she stares in the distance at what appears to be nothing. She collects herself for a moment and continues, 'You will be welcome here, of course, because of all of your hard work bringing us new workers. I await your return, mercenary.'\nShe hands you: The Rise of the Akhevan Empire [item=142714]\n\n---\n\n1\\. Gather a rubbing from a monument in the western room of the temple 0/1 Ka Vethan\n> **Quest Text:** Itaer Centien Rashen's ego has blinded her to the fact that you are not actually aligned with the same goals as the akheva in Ka Vethan. This is a good time to gather some intel about what is going on inside of the sacred space.\n>\n> In the westernmost room of the temple, there are three statues. Go behind them to get a rubbing of what's on the backside for Itraer Centien Rashen.\nThis and the next two updates, the western most room has large monuments and they are surrounded by Gel`Temariel Centi mobs. Go on the backside of these monuments right up against them about the midway point and the task should update. You should see the below message in yellow.\nYou take a moment to copy the information that you find from the monument into the book. The images depict Luclin directing her creations to grow and prosper.\nYour task 'Record Scratch' has been updated.\n2\\. Gather a rubbing from a monument in the western room of the temple 0/1 Ka Vethan\nYou take a moment to copy the information that you find from the monument into the book. The images depict Luclin directing her creations to grow and prosper.\nYour task 'Record Scratch' has been updated.\n3\\. Gather a rubbing from a monument in the western room of the temple 0/1 Ka Vethan\nYou take a moment to copy the information that you find from the monument into the book. The images depict Luclin directing her creations to grow and prosper.\nYour task 'Record Scratch' has been updated.\n4\\. Deliver the book to Itraer Centien Rashen 0/1 Ka Vethan\nUpon Hand In Of: The Rise of the Akhevan Empire\nYou have been given: The Rise of the Akhevan Empire\nYour task 'Record Scratch' has been updated.\nItraer Centien Rashen examines the rubbings you have gathered. She takes out a small, red colored writing implement and marks a few things on the pages before handing the book back. 'Very good, the story you collected is the start of our glorious campaign across Luclin. You, my...friend, get to work alongside us during this time. You will also be honored in our history books much like these writings. Speaking of which, there are two more writings we need to gather. This time they are from the monuments outside of the servants' quarters. You can find that area in the southeast of the temple. The writings here are to remind our custodians of what it is they are fighting for. They must gaze upon those monuments every time they wish to partake in their duties. They will not forget these teachings. With your help, we will make sure they will never be lost again.'\n5\\. Gather a rubbing from a monument on the way to the servant's quarters in the southeast area of the temple 0/1 Ka Vethan\nThere are two monuments in the southeast section of the zone at -583, -927, 13. You can find this area going north from the Maiden's Eye zone line and then taking the first right you get to, it leads you right into this area.\nDo the same thing, get on the backside of the monuments about halfway until you see this,\nYou take a moment to copy the information that you find from the monument into the book. The images depicted show many akheva working together to rebuild Ka Vethan. Luclin herself is watching over the construction of the temple. Tendrils of darkness are seen weaving away from her hands, showing that she personally helped with Ka Vethan's revival.\nYour task 'Record Scratch' has been updated.\n6\\. Gather a rubbing from a monument on the way to the servant's quarters in the southeast area of the temple 0/1 Ka Vethan\nYou take a moment to copy the information that you find from the monument into the book. The images depicted show many akheva working together to rebuild Ka Vethan. Luclin herself is watching over the construction of the temple. Tendrils of darkness are seen weaving away from her hands, showing that she personally helped with Ka Vethan's revival.\nYour task 'Record Scratch' has been updated.\n7\\. Return the book to Itraer Centien Rashen 0/1 Ka Vethan\nUpon Hand in of: The Rise of the Akhevan Empire\nYour task 'Record Scratch' has been updated.\nItraer Centien Rashen looks pleased with your return, which is odd because she hasn't looked pleased since you have met her, 'Ah, I do so hope that you took the time to absorb the teachings on these monuments. They are very vital to our work here.' She takes the book and again places some red markings on it. It appears she may be correcting it, but you are not certain of this. Itraer looks up after realizing you have been watching her for some time. 'Oh, right! My apologies, your kind loves having more busy work to do. I found out that my Centi have been infiltrated by the usurpers who claim they have a right to their own lives. These \"rebels,\" as they like to think of themselves, are sowing dissent within the ranks. I need you to cull them. Don't worry if you get any loyalists, we have ways to get them back. Luclin will bring the truth out sooner or later, she always does. Ignore any Centi who are shades, as they can't be disloyal, and the tegi are too stupid to break ranks. The monuments are enough to keep them in check.'\n8\\. Slay Akhevan Centi (0/8) Ka Vethan\n9\\. Return to Itraer Centien Rashen (0/1) Ka Vethan\n10\\. Solve the diviner's riddle and collect what you find (0/1) Ka Vethan\n_\"Where once was peace, now is destruction. Four hold danger, where once was tranquility. Fine me in the show of the conqueror.\"_\nHead North from Itraer Centien Rashen to next room, turn East and go to the back of the statue. Pick up the ground spawned Scroll of Ka Vethan Intel [item=142938] at /loc +236.86, -1599.07, +6.00. it has around a 90 second respawn timer.\n11\\. Bring the papers to Itraer Centien Rashen (0/1) Ka Vethan\nTurn in the ground spawn to complete the task.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney for your level\nExperience for your level\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
