      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ka Vethan [zone=1283]\n**Who:**\n- Terro Kai [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bloodied Kai Family Ring [item=143017]\n- Cleansed Kai Family Ring [item=142954]\n- Corrupted Vampyre Blood [item=142898]\n- Feral Vampire Blood [item=142950]\n- Ka Vethan Shackle Key [item=142955]\n- Kai Family Ring [item=142715]\n- Tainted Kai Family Ring [item=142952]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Basilica of Adumbration [zone=1280]\n- Bloodfalls [zone=1286]\n- Maiden's Eye [ToL]\n- Shadow Valley [zone=1281]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Ceesil Ahdai [ _Quests_]\n- a grim shade [npc=56924]\n- a shimmering presence - ToL [npc=57392]\n- a worthy sacrifice [npc=56964]\n- an ashen shade [npc=56944]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Ka Vethan (10 Points) [quest=10581]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 26 00:29:01 2021\nModified: Sun May 31 04:35:40 2026 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this quest by speaking to Terro Kai in Ka Vethan. You can find him locked in a cage about mid zone off in a big room in the northwest corner of it. You can find him via the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Terro Kai'\nTerro Kai looks at you with a forlorn look, his wrists and ankles are being held in shackles. 'So many lives lost for nothing, so many families ruined...' he mumbles to himself before realizing that you are paying attention to him. 'Wait, you aren't a mercenary! Maybe you can help! I came here because my brother was kidnapped and taken here. When I approached the [ruins], I was shocked to find that they had been rebuilt!'\nYou say, 'ruins'\nTerro Kai says, 'Indeed, the ruins that were once here are now, as you can see restored. The shock that came over the fact that nobody had any clue that it was being rebuilt. The akheva here kept this secret well. However, in an attempt to locate my brother, I was captured and apparently am going to be forced into labor or worse, [sacrificed]. My kin have no idea where I am, they just know that I left to find my brother and never returned. '\nYou say, 'sacrificed'\nTerro Kai begins to tear up a bit as they continue, 'The akheva here have been bolstered and believe that their cause is not only just, but righteous.' he takes a moment to compose himself, 'This is why I [desperately] need your help.\nYou say, 'I can see that you are desperately in need of help.'\nTerro Kai says, 'Yes. For the time being, it appears I may be fine from any permanent abuse. I can handle whatever work they might be able to throw at me for now, but my main goal is to find out what happened to my [brother]. '\nYou say, 'When did you last see your brother?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Live as Brothers or Perish as Fools'.\nTerro Kai says, 'He has been gone for what feels like weeks, though exactly how long I cannot say, as time is a little different here on the moon of Luclin. He was an adventurer, much like you. He was last seen going into the direction of these ruins. I think he may still be here, though I do not know where. I shudder to think where he may be though. Please adventurer, can you see if you can locate him? If you don't find him working for the shades, we may be too late already. Here, take this ring to the sacrifice pits. Try searching pits for a ring that looks like Kai Family Ring. If you find it, please bring it back to me so I can know my brother's fate.'\nYou are given: Kai Family Ring [item=142715]\n\n---\n\n1\\. Examine the bodies of the slain in the sacrifice pit 0/1 Ka Vethan\n> **Quest Text:** Terro Kai was in search for his lost brother when he discovered that Ka Vethan has been restored. As he searched for his brother, he was captured by the akheva and forced to do manual labor. He has asked you to help determine what has happened to his brother.\n>\n> Search the bodies in the sacrifice pits until you find a family ring. Terro gave you his ring that will resonate with other family rings. Use this on the corpses of the sacrificed to find Karro.\nTarget a worthy sacrifice [npc=56964] and right click Kai Family Ring.\nYour task 'Live as Brothers or Perish as Fools' has been updated.\nIf successful, you will get a Bloodied Kai Family Ring [item=143017].\n2\\. Return the Bloodied Ring to Terro Kai 0/1 Ka Vethan\nUpon turn in:\nYour task 'Live as Brothers or Perish as Fools' has been updated.\nTerro Kai stares at the Kai Family Ring for a moment, you can tell that he is in shock with this news. 'I...\" he stammers, 'I guess that answers that question...[Karro Kai], you will be missed, but not forgotten.' Terro Kai collects himself again, if only for a moment. 'Ok adventurer, we have some work to do.' he says, while his voice sounds to be on the verge of breaking. 'So, we know the akheva have been performing some dark magic involving blood of vampyres...'\n3\\. Return the Ring to Terro Kai 0/1 Ka Vethan\nGive him the Kai Family Ring.\nUpon turn in:\nYour task 'Live as Brothers or Perish as Fools' has been updated.\nTerro Kai says, 'Ah, thank you, I will keep this someplace safe.'\n4\\. Retrieve a sample of feral vampyre blood in the Bloodfalls 0/1 Bloodfalls\nFeral Vampire Blood [item=142950] drops off feral vampires in Bloodfalls.\n5\\. Retrieve a sample of Corrupted Vampyre Blood from the Maiden's Eye outpost 0/1 Maiden's Eye\nCorrupted Vampyre Blood [item=142898] drops off akhevans in Maiden's Eye.\n6\\. Deliver the Feral Vampyre Blood to Terro Kai 0/1 Ka Vethan\n7\\. Deliver the Corrupted Vampyre Blood to Terro Kai 0/1 Ka Vethan\nHead back to Ka Vethan and give both blood vials to Terro Kai.\nTerro Kai takes the vials from you and holds them up to the nearest light source, examining them. 'I think this will do. There is a blessing my clan has for situations like this, maybe I will be able to...' As Terro Kai attempts whatever it is that he is trying to attempt, a loud roar can be heard from the back of your mind. 'You heard that too huh? I don't think I have the ability to do anything with this right now. I have prepared it for the next step. You will need to locate Ceesil Ahdai within the walls of the Basilica of Adumbration. Bring him this Kai Family Ring and explain to him what is happening. He will be able to assist further.'\nYou receive Tainted Kai Family Ring [item=142952].\n8\\. Deliver the ring to Ceesil Ahdai 0/1 Basilica of Adumbration\nCeesil Ahdai accepts the Kai Family Ring from you and already appears to recognize the issue at hand. 'This was Karro Kai's ring. I bet that fool of a brother of his went looking for Karro after we told him not to. We told him to wait but much like his brother, he didn't listen. This Kai Family Ring needs to be cleansed, but before I do that, I need you to do me a favor. On the way here I was spotted by a group of shades who were following me. I need you to get them off my back for a bit if you want me to do my work. I'll work on preparing this for Terro Kai to free his brother's spirit. You work on clearing out those shades.'\n9\\. Kill shades in Shadow Valley 0/10 Shadow Valley\nIn Shadow Valley, kill 10 grim shades [npc=56924] or an ashen shade [npc=56944].\n10\\. Return to Ceesil 0/1 Basilica of Adumbration\nYou say, 'Hail, Ceesil Ahdai'\nCeesil Ahdai snorts in the air as you return, 'Hey, you made it back. I can tell by the lack of shades following you that you were able to take care of those for me. Thanks for that. In the meantime, I was able to cleanse this thing for you, bring it back to Terro Kai in Ka Vethan. Oh and bring him this key too. He will be able to use this to free himself from the shackles he's in. He will have to find his own way out, but then again, we didn't get him captured in the first place. Good luck.'\nYou receive Cleansed Kai Family Ring [item=142954] and Ka Vethan Shackle Key [item=142955].\n11\\. Speak with Terro 0/1 Ka Vethan\n12\\. Give the Cleansed Kai Family Ring to the shimmering presence 0/1 Ka Vethan\n13\\. Give the Shackle Key to Terro Kai 0/1 Ka Vethan\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
