      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ka Vethan [zone=1283]\n**Who:**\n- Kela Xin Dabo [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Corrupted Ka Vethan Dagger [item=142941]\n- Vial of Black Bile [item=142851]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Diabo Sivuela [ _Quests_]\n- Diabo Xin Thall [npc=56983]\n- Vius Centi - ToL [npc=56974]\n- a ritual table [npc=56985]\n- a shade guardian [npc=56962]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Ka Vethan (10 Points) [quest=10581]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 26 01:03:55 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can obtain this quest from Kela Xin Dabo in Ka Vethan. He can be found locked in a cage in the room straight north of the Maiden's Eye zone out. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Kela Xin Dabo'\nKela Xin Dabo speaks in a hushed, yet direct tone, 'Don't look directly at me, don't do anything strange to draw attention to us [conversing] together. Say something demeaning to me, quick!'\nYou say, 'Know your place, knave!'\nKela Xin Dabo raises his voice so others can hear. He winces and takes an even more submissive posture than before, 'I'm sorry!' He returns to a quieted hush, 'Perfect execution! That will buy us some time. I'm Kela Xin Dabo and I am a part of the resistance movement that you may have worked with before you came here. Right now, it's apparent that you aren't too welcome here. There are a few [adventurers] who have free reign to roam these halls. That is because they are doing the akheva a favor, for now.'\nYou say, 'Adventurers? Like me?'\nKela Xin Dabo says, 'No, not like you. These are mercenaries who are being paid to round up victims for these monsters to slaughter in the name of our goddess. My brethren have become emboldened since [Luclin] visited these hallways to look upon the works that were created. '\nYou say, 'Luclin'\nKela Xin Dabo says, 'I would be lying if I didn't say that I, too, was infatuated with her beauty. She was stunning, incredible, resplendent, and more importantly, [pleased]. This has, in turn, created a renewed vigor amongst my fellow akheva. Never would we have realized how much of a rift this would create amongst our people.'\nYou say, 'She was pleased with what she saw?'\nKela Xin Dabo says, 'She doted upon our work, blessing every stone with her presence. When she left our temple, that was when we disagreed upon the direction of the akhevan people. Many are determined to not just let Ka Vethan be the seat of power for the Akhevan Empire, but all of the moon. This land has been home to many creatures, but my brethren wish to wipe out the rest of the life here and take it for themselves. That is where the [rebellion] comes in.'\nYou say, 'rebellion'\nKela Xin Dabo says, 'Many decided that it was time to create a campaign to take over the moon long ago, but it was only until recently that they were able to get more steam behind that idea. One such entity who had this idea was Diabo Xin Thall, who zealously has created a routine of sacrifices in order to bolster their numbers. When a sacrifice is slain, the newly harvested soul is used to bring back a slain akhevan. The rebellion does not have access to these tools. If we can gather enough tools from here, the rebels will be in less danger of being wiped out completely. Now, before you go do that, [berate] me one more time.'\nYou say, 'Don't you ever look me in the eyes again you maggot!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Back to the Middle and Around Again'.\nKela Xin Dabo whimpers as you bark at him, saying under his breath, 'Excellent, now get out of here.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Retrieve the Ritual Dagger from Diabo Xin Thall 0/1 Ka Vethan\nYou will need to kill him. It drops 6 Daggers to distribute amongst the group.\n2\\. Return the Dagger to Kela Xin Dabo (0/1) Ka Vethan\nTurn in the Ritual Dagger to Kela Xin Dabo.\n3\\. Acquire Black Bile from Shades (0/5) Ka Vethan\nVile of Black Vile CANNOT be pre-looted. Must be looted during this phase of quest.\n4\\. Deliver the Black Bile to Kela Xin Dabo (0/5) Ka Vethan\n5\\. Slay Strong Willed Tegi (0/4) Ka Vethan\nThe Fer'Tatrua Centi down buy the SV zone out area (and in rooms around there) fulfill this one. Also the purple Vius Centi also work for this part.\n6\\. Return to Kela Xin Dabo (0/1) Ka Vethan\n7\\. Place the dagger on the Ritual Table (0/1) Ka Vethan\nNote: The ritual table will knock all invis off. Make sure you pre-clear before you do this step.\n8\\. Speak with Kela Xin Dabo (0/1) Ka Vethan\nYou have been given: Encoded Resistance Missive [item=142942]\nKela Xin Dabo says, 'They will have to make a whole new dagger before they realize what had happened. By the time that happens, they will have wasted a lot of time and resources into trying to figure out why the ritual isn't working for them. This is perfect. I have written out what I was able to glean from my time here in this missive. Bring it to Diabo Sivuela, he will have a cipher that will decode the message for him.'\n9\\. Deliver the encoded message to Diabo Sivuela (0/1) Maiden's Eye\nDiabo Sivuela takes the missive you have given him and places another piece of paper over it. This must be the cipher that Kela Xin Dabo was talking about. He pours over the note with the cipher, making acknowledgement sounds before speaking directly. 'This information is vital to us, and this is yet another step in being able to save our people from total devastation. Thank you again, mortal. We would just be surviving if not for you, now we are ready to thrive.'\nThe rituals in Ka Vethan have been sabotaged. The akheva will have a difficult time replenishing their numbers.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
